3
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,280
Yeah, Ms. Wang,

4
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:39,879
please.

5
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:40,879
You're the best.

6
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:41,959
Ms. Wang,

7
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,200
please help us.

8
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:43,920
Our show

9
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,359
is definitely unique.

10
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,439
I'm really sorry.

11
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:49,120
There are just too many

12
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,280
performances this time.

13
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,319
We have to close the sign-up early.

14
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,040
Zhou Yang,

15
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,719
you know the situation.

16
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,159
Ms. Wang,

17
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:59,319
with so many performances, there must be many similar ones.

18
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,519
We're a band, we're unique.

19
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:02,519
Can you

20
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,120
squeeze us in?

21
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,400
I'm really at my wit's end.

22
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,159
Because

23
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:10,319
the director has already taken away

24
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,120
the application form.

25
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,840
If you really want to do this,

26
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,560
you can go ask him.

27
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,000
Zhou Yang.

28
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,319
Thank you. I'm leaving.

29
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,719
Submarine?

30
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:23,759
It's no use negotiating with him.

31
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,800
Senior Li Haoyu.

32
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,520
Chen Song.

33
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,680
You remember me?

34
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,039
Of course.

35
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,520
He stands in the sunset,

36
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,680
his shadow so long

37
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:42,439
that it can't reach yesterday's self.

38
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,319
What the hell is this?

39
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:45,439
So cheesy.

40
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:47,599
You wrote scripts for the Drama Club?

41
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:49,680
Who would want to perform your stuff?

42
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:50,520
Please.

43
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,639
I beg you.

44
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:52,840
Give it back to me.

45
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,599
Please give it back to me.

46
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,520
If you want it back,

47
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,439
you have to perform a scene for us first.

48
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:58,599
Perform a scene.

49
00:02:58,599 --> 00:02:59,280
Do you want it back or not?

50
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,240
Perform a scene.

51
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,800
Perform a scene.

52
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,199
Perform a scene. Come on.

53
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,439
How about I perform for you three?

54
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,319
Perform.

55
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:08,719
Yu, we were just kidding around.

56
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:09,759
Just kidding around.

57
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:16,840
Do you find it fun?

58
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:20,199
Did you see that?

59
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:21,680
He doesn't think it's fun.

60
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:22,719
How about you three

61
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:23,719
perform a scene for us?

62
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,879
I'm sorry.

63
00:03:26,879 --> 00:03:28,080
Say sorry to me.

64
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,039
Sorry.

65
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,400
Louder.

66
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,319
Sorry.

67
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,759
Anything else?

68
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,400
Go, go, go.

69
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,039
Are you in the Drama Club?

70
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,680
Not yet.

71
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,439
But

72
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,680
I want to join it.

73
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,599
Just do it.

74
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:58,840
I just read your script.

75
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,080
It's quite good.

76
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,280
Believe in yourself.

77
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:04,479
Keep it up.

78
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,039
By the way,

79
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,520
if anyone

80
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,520
bullies you again,

81
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:14,599
just say you're with me.

82
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,480
What's your name?

83
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,399
Chen Song.

84
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,240
East ear Chen, Song as in song.

85
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,800
Chen Song, I'll remember you.

86
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,480
Let's go.

87
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,079
Good for you, Chen Song.

88
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:41,879
You're the president of the Drama Club.

89
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,639
Actually, it's because

90
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:45,480
there are fewer and fewer members in the club.

91
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,319
And it takes a long time

92
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,800
to prepare a stage.

93
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,800
The school provides little funds.

94
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:52,240
It's hard to get credits.

95
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,399
So no one

96
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,639
don't want to participate.

97
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,079
So,

98
00:04:58,879 --> 00:04:59,879
did you sign up

99
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,959
for the arts festival?

100
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,240
Yes,

101
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,680
but

102
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,319
maybe we won't perform.

103
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,399
What happened?

104
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,160
Did someone bully you?

105
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,480
I wrote a script,

106
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:15,800
but

107
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,160
every actor has an opinion.

108
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:19,079
I can't finish the revision.

109
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,600
Do you think

110
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,959
their opinions make sense?

111
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,439
I... I don't know.

112
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,079
I just hope

113
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,839
every actor is satisfied.

114
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,079
How is that possible?

115
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:33,120
Your script.

116
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,240
You should listen to yourself.

117
00:05:34,759 --> 00:05:36,040
If it's not good enough,

118
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:37,680
no one will want to perform.

119
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:40,879
How many actors do you still need?

120
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,519
Many.

121
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,839
I have an idea.

122
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,000
Director.

123
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,079
Here.

124
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,439
The registration form is filled out.

125
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:03,360
After much consideration,

126
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,839
I've decided not to participate

127
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:05,959
in the Olympiad this year.

128
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,160
I hope you understand.

129
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,600
Zhou Yang is too busy to manage.

130
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,720
You couldn't convince him?

131
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,600
Then tell me,

132
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,240
what about Yibei's

133
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:22,879
olympiad results this year?

134
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,000
Have you thought about it?

135
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,279
I think about it every day.

136
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,680
Because of this,

137
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:30,360
I...

138
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,120
I lost a lot of hair.

139
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,040
Look.

140
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,600
You can see that

141
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:36,439
I have less hair.

142
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:40,879
I can buy you a bottle of hair tonic.

143
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,600
Is that the point?

144
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,480
My boy.

145
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,079
Bin Yan

146
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,839
You always say you have something to do.

147
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,279
I just want to know

148
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,879
what is so important

149
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,439
to make you miss the Olympiad?

150
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,639
Is it the Basketball Club?

151
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,600
If you think the Basketball Club

152
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,800
is taking up your time,

153
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,959
you can quit it.

154
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:02,959
Director

155
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,240
Come in.

156
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,360
Can you?

157
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,920
What's up?

158
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,920
This is the new program list for the Arts Festival.

159
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,720
Please take a look.

160
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,879
I need to think about it.

161
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,720
Previously,

162
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:18,120
