163
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,720
the student union rejected many programs.

164
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,920
Later, the Basketball Club and the Drama Club

165
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,879
proposed to create together,

166
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,360
which opened up our minds.

167
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,839
Finally, many programs

168
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:27,040
were cooperated.

169
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,040
This year's Arts Festival,

170
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,120
we've got more students

171
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,959
and performances

172
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:30,879
on stage.

173
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,680
I'm sure it's gonna be awesome.

174
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,600
Basketball Club again?

175
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,199
You've been

176
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,319
making waves lately.

177
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:42,480
Zhou Yang,

178
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,120
it's great

179
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,600
that you're doing well in basketball,

180
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,120
but remember,

181
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,240
