182
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:50,959
Got it?

183
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:53,199
You're right.

184
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,720
That's why I'm here today

185
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,519
to submit my application.

186
00:07:58,519 --> 00:08:00,240
I've decided to join this year's Olympiad.

187
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,240
What?

188
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,920
Good, good.

189
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,519
Zhou Yang, let me tell you,

190
00:08:10,519 --> 00:08:11,680
with you on board,

191
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,399
Yibei has a real shot this year.

192
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:16,120
I'll be going now, sir.

193
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,160
Okay.

194
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,680
Great!

195
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,800
We're all set now!

196
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,800
All set!

197
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:40,240
Sir, I've decided to join the Olympiad.

198
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,120
Sir, I'll be going now.

199
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,679
You...

200
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,879
My words carry weight.

201
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,039
Zhou Yang,

202
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:02,120
didn't you say

203
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,519
