204
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,480
It's just a competition.

205
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:07,039
It doesn't take much effort.

206
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,320
We two are a team in the Olympiad.

207
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,159
We can maximize efficiency.

208
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,120
It won't affect your stay in the team.

209
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:14,360
You have the student union

210
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,679
and the basketball team.

211
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,440
And you still have to take part in the Olympiad.

212
00:09:17,919 --> 00:09:19,360
You're really hard-working.

213
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,039
It's just a competition.

214
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,440
It doesn't take much effort.

215
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:46,879
Excuse me.

216
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,159
Hello.

217
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:50,200
Hello, hello.

218
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,039
You two

219
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:54,559
must be Lin Qingyuan's parents, right?

220
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,240
How do you know?

221
00:09:57,279 --> 00:09:58,919
I'm Gu Chenyang's mother.

222
00:09:58,919 --> 00:09:59,639
He said

223
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:01,480
I would sit with you.

224
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:02,799
Hello, Chenyang's mom.

225
00:10:02,799 --> 00:10:04,120
Nice to meet you.

226
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,879
Welcome to

227
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,879
Yibei Middle School.

228
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:09,720
We uphold the core education concept

229
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,720
of simultaneous development of five aspects

230
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,120
to encourage every child to shine.

231
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,000
Of course,

232
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,519
this wouldn't be possible without the

233
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,159
support of higher authorities for private education.

234
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:18,399
I hope everyone

235
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:20,080
will capture more of our children's

236
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,320
precious moments

237
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,240
and spread the spirit

238
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:28,000
of our Yibei students.

239
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:30,279
Thank you.

240
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:31,519
Thank you all for your hard work.

241
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:32,720
Let's get ready to start.

242
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,679
Ready to start.

243
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,120
Okay.

244
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,000
Director.

245
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:36,840
Okay.

246
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,720
Mom, just focus on your work.

247
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,879
The entire performance will be recorded.

248
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:06,960
I'll show you later.

249
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:09,919
I can't be there to see your performance.

250
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:10,600
I still feel

251
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,759
