252
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,360
I'm sorry, son.

253
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:14,480
It's okay.

254
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,240
It's work, after all.

255
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,720
Auntie, don't be sad.

256
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,720
If it's really not okay,

257
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,960
