260
00:11:24,399 --> 00:11:25,679
I'll send you the photos later.

261
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:27,200
Auntie, and me too.

262
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:29,200
I'll definitely take lots of photos.

263
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:29,960
Okay, okay.

264
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,480
Thank you all.

265
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:33,519
Okay, we'll let you go.

266
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,679
Have a safe trip.

267
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,840
Thank you, and good luck

268
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,720
