269
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,360
Thank you.

270
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:40,320
I'm hanging up now. Bye.

271
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,279
Bye.

272
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,879
Where's Li Haoyu?

273
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:46,759
I haven't seen him.

274
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:50,320
Make way for your prince!

275
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,720
So cool, Your Highness.

276
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,759
Definitely.

277
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:55,320
Now that we're all here,

278
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,639
let's take a group photo

279
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,039
